<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy - Write Bee</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd1df 0%, #d4e6ff 50%, #e6d9ff 100%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: #5c4033; /* Soft brown for text to match the wooden theme */
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #fff9e6; /* Beige board */
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            border: 12px solid #ffb74d; /* Orange/wood border */
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1), inset 0 0 0 8px #ffcc80;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Decorative elements */
        .container::before {
            content: '🐾';
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 30px;
            font-size: 30px;
            color: #ffb74d;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }
        .container::after {
            content: '⭐';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 30px;
            font-size: 30px;
            color: #ffb74d;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }
        .star-top-right {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: 30px;
            font-size: 30px;
            color: #ffb74d;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }
        .paw-bottom-left {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 30px;
            font-size: 30px;
            color: #ffb74d;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            color: #ff6b81;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            margin-top: 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #ff4757, 0 10px 20px rgba(255, 107, 129, 0.3);
        }

        h2 {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            color: #1e90ff; /* Blue */
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            border-bottom: 5px dashed #7bed9f; /* Green dashed line */
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #70a1ff;
        }

        h3 {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            color: #ffa502; /* Orange */
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        ul {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding-left: 40px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            position: relative;
            list-style-type: none;
        }

        li::before {
            content: '⭐';
            position: absolute;
            left: -35px;
            top: 0;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        /* Glossy bubbly button links */
        a {
            color: #ffffff;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ff9ff3 0%, #f368e0 100%);
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 800;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0px #c236b6, 0 8px 15px rgba(243, 104, 224, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.1s;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 4px 0;
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        a:hover {
            transform: translateY(4px);
            box-shadow: 0 0px 0px #c236b6, 0 4px 10px rgba(243, 104, 224, 0.4);
        }

        .header-info {
            text-align: center;
            color: #747d8c;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            border: 4px dashed #ced6e0;
            display: inline-block;
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        .header-info p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }

        .highlight {
            background-color: #ffeb3b;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ff4757;
            border: 3px solid #f39c12;
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 60px;
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 5px dashed #ffb74d;
            color: #a4b0be;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="star-top-right">⭐</div>
        <div class="paw-bottom-left">🐾</div>
        
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        
        <div class="header-info">
            <p><strong>🎮 App Name:</strong> Write Bee</p>
            <p><strong>👨‍💻 Developed By:</strong> Dhruvil Mangukiya</p>
            <p><strong>🏢 Company:</strong> Alphaved Private Limited</p>
            <p><strong>📅 Last Updated:</strong> October 6, 2026</p>
