        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>Welcome to <span class="highlight">Write Bee</span> (the "App"), an amazing educational mobile application developed by <strong>Dhruvil Mangukiya</strong> and provided by <strong>Alphaved Private Limited</strong> ("we," "us," or "our"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our application on the Apple App Store and Google Play Store.</p>
        <p>Because our App is an educational tool designed specially for children, we take privacy very seriously and are fully committed to complying with the Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA) and other applicable international privacy laws.</p>

        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <h3>A. Personal Information</h3>
        <p>We <strong>do not</strong> knowingly collect personally identifiable information (such as names, addresses, or email addresses) from children under the age of 13. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such information, please contact us immediately so we can promptly and securely delete it.</p>

        <h3>B. Non-Personal & Automatically Collected Information</h3>
        <p>When you use the App, we or our trusted third-party service providers may automatically collect certain non-personal information solely to improve the App's performance and provide a better experience. This may include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>📱 Device information (e.g., device model, operating system version)</li>
            <li>🎮 App usage data (e.g., time spent on levels, feature usage, educational progress)</li>
            <li>🛠️ Anonymous crash reports and diagnostic data</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use trusted third-party services to operate, maintain, and improve our App. These services are bound by their own privacy policies and are heavily restricted from using children's data for targeted advertising. The services we use may include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Firebase / Google Analytics:</strong> Used for analytics, crash reporting, and securely saving game progress. <br><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
            <li><strong>RevenueCat:</strong> Used to manage in-app purchases and subscriptions securely. <br><a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy" target="_blank">RevenueCat Privacy Policy</a></li>
            <li><strong>Unity:</strong> The game engine used to build the App. <br><a href="https://unity3d.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank">Unity Privacy Policy</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. In-App Purchases</h2>
        <p>Our App may offer in-app purchases (e.g., unlocking new levels or premium features). All transactions are securely processed directly through the Apple App Store or Google Play Store. <strong>We do not collect, process, or store your payment information on our servers.</strong></p>

        <h2>5. Security of Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use industry-standard administrative, logical, and physical security measures to protect your information. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your data, please be aware that no method of transmission over the internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure.</p>

        <h2>6. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy within the App and updating the "Last Updated" date. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically.</p>

        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please feel free to reach out to us at:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>📧 Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@alphaved.com">support@alphaved.com</a></li>
            <li><strong>🏢 Company:</strong> Alphaved Private Limited</li>
            <li><strong>👨‍💻 Developer:</strong> Dhruvil Mangukiya</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2026 Alphaved Private Limited. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
